==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Lazer (Enemy)|Dark Lazer]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 0.33~1.33 seconds<sup>10f~40f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s (800%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns.
**2 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

